       "content": "```python\ndef correct_bracketing(brackets: str):\n    \"\"\" brackets is a string of \"(\" and \")\".\n    return True if every opening bracket has a corresponding closing bracket.\n\n    >>> correct_bracketing(\"(\")\n    False\n    >>> correct_bracketing(\"()\")\n    True\n    >>> correct_bracketing(\"(()())\")\n    True\n    >>> correct_bracketing(\")(()\")\n    False\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for bracket in brackets:\n        if bracket == '(':\n            count += 1\n        elif bracket == ')':\n            count -= 1\n        if count < 0:\n            return False\n    return count == 0\n```",
